msgstr "请参考[特性指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/index.md)了解特性配置信息。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:17
msgid "3 Prerequisites"
msgstr "3 前提条件"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:19
msgid "3.1 Model Weight"
msgstr "3.1 模型权重"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:21
msgid ""
"The BF16 model can be deployed with one Ascend 910B 64 GB NPU or one Ascend "
"Atlas 300I DUO 48 GB NPU. Download the model weights from "
"[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B)."
msgstr ""
"BF16模型可以使用一个Ascend 910B 64 GB NPU或一个Ascend Atlas 300I DUO 48 GB "
"NPU进行部署。从[ModelScope](https://www.modelscope.cn/models/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B)下载模型权重。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:23
msgid ""
"Download the weights to a directory that is accessible from the deployment "
"environment. For multi-node deployments, use a shared directory; for "
"example, `/root/.cache/`."
msgstr "将权重下载到部署环境可访问的目录。对于多节点部署，请使用共享目录，例如 `/root/.cache/`。"

