#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:117
msgid "5 Online Service Deployment"
msgstr "5 在线服务部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:119
msgid "5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "5.1 单节点在线部署"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:121
msgid ""
"Single-node deployment runs both audio prefill and decoding on one NPU, "
"making it suitable for development, testing, and small-scale ASR services. "
"Replace `your_model_path` with the local model directory, or use "
"`Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B` to download the model through the configured model "
"hub."
msgstr ""
"单节点部署将音频预填充和解码运行在同一张 NPU 上，适用于开发、测试及小规模 ASR 服务。将 `your_model_path` "
"替换为本地模型目录，或使用 `Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B` 通过已配置的模型仓库下载模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:157
msgid "Key parameters Descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:159
msgid ""
"`--tensor-parallel-size 1` uses one NPU. Increase it only after confirming "
"that the hardware and deployment topology support the chosen parallel "
"configuration."
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size 1` 使用一张 NPU。仅在确认硬件和部署拓扑支持所选并行配置后，再增加该值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:160
msgid ""
"`--max-model-len 4096` limits the maximum sequence length. On Atlas 300I "
"DUO, always specify a conservative value explicitly; automatic detection can"
" allocate an oversized attention mask and cause an out-of-memory error."
msgstr ""
"`--max-model-len 4096` 限制最大序列长度。在 Atlas 300I DUO "
"上，务必显式指定一个保守值；自动检测可能分配过大的注意力掩码并导致内存不足错误。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:161
msgid ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization 0.9` sets the fraction of device memory available "
"to the vLLM executor. Lower this value if other workloads share the NPU."
msgstr ""
"`--gpu-memory-utilization 0.9` 设置 vLLM 执行器可用的设备内存比例。如果其他工作负载共享 NPU，请降低此值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:162
msgid ""
"`--enforce-eager` disables graph execution. It is used in the Atlas 300I A2 "
"2UP example for compatibility."
msgstr "`--enforce-eager` 禁用图执行。在 Atlas 300I A2 2UP 示例中用于兼容性。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:164
msgid ""
"When the service starts successfully, the log contains `Application startup "
"complete`. If startup fails, see the [Public "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)."
msgstr ""
"服务启动成功后，日志中包含 `Application startup complete`。如果启动失败，请参阅[公共 "
"FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:166
msgid "6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "6 功能验证"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:168
msgid ""
"After the service is started, the model can be invoked by sending a prompt."
msgstr "服务启动后，可通过发送提示词来调用模型。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:170
msgid "**Chat Completions API:**"
msgstr "**聊天补全 API：**"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:195
msgid ""
"Replace `localhost`, `8000`, and `qwen3-asr` with the address, port, and "
"`--served-model-name` used by your deployment. Expected result: HTTP 200 and"
" a JSON response containing the transcription in the `choices` field."
msgstr ""
"将 `localhost`、`8000` 和 `qwen3-asr` 替换为部署所用的地址、端口和 `--served-model-"
"name`。预期结果：HTTP 200 及包含转录文本的 JSON 响应（位于 `choices` 字段中）。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:197
msgid "7 Accuracy Evaluation"
msgstr "7 精度评估"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:199
msgid ""
"Evaluate transcription quality with Word Error Rate (WER) for word-level "
"recognition and Character Error Rate (CER) for character-level recognition."
msgstr "使用词错误率（WER）评估词级识别质量，使用字符错误率（CER）评估字符级识别质量。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:201
msgid "8 Performance Evaluation"
msgstr "8 性能评估"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:203
msgid ""
"Measure ASR serving performance with audio samples that represent the "
"production workload. Record at least the audio duration, request "
"concurrency, end-to-end latency, real-time factor, and throughput. This "
"ensures that audio preprocessing, request construction, API communication, "
"inference, and response parsing are included in the result."
msgstr ""
"使用代表生产工作负载的音频样本测量 ASR "
"服务性能。至少记录音频时长、请求并发数、端到端延迟、实时因子和吞吐量。这确保结果包含音频预处理、请求构建、API 通信、推理和响应解析。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:205
msgid ""
"Actual performance varies with hardware, audio duration, concurrency, and "
"deployment configuration. Evaluate short audio, long audio, and concurrent "
"requests separately before selecting a production configuration."
msgstr "实际性能因硬件、音频时长、并发数和部署配置而异。在选择生产配置前，请分别评估短音频、长音频和并发请求。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:207
msgid "9 Performance Tuning"
msgstr "9 性能调优"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:209
msgid ""
"The following settings are starting points rather than globally optimal "
"configurations. Tune them according to audio duration, concurrency, latency "
"requirements, and available NPU memory."
msgstr "以下设置是起点而非全局最优配置。请根据音频时长、并发数、延迟要求和可用 NPU 内存进行调整。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Scenario"
msgstr "场景"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Recommended Starting Point"
msgstr "推荐起点"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Key Considerations"
msgstr "关键考量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Low latency"
msgstr "低延迟"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "`--tensor-parallel-size 1`, `--max-model-len 4096`"
msgstr "`--tensor-parallel-size 1`, `--max-model-len 4096`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Use short audio inputs and avoid sharing the NPU with other workloads."
msgstr "使用短音频输入，避免与其他工作负载共享 NPU。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "High throughput"
msgstr "高吞吐量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Increase request concurrency after establishing the latency baseline"
msgstr "在建立延迟基线后增加请求并发数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid ""
"Monitor NPU memory and end-to-end latency; do not use synthetic text-only "
"requests as a proxy for ASR traffic."
msgstr "监控NPU内存和端到端延迟；不要使用合成的纯文本请求作为ASR流量的代理。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Long audio"
msgstr "长音频"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid "Increase `--max-model-len` only as required"
msgstr "仅在必要时增加`--max-model-len`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:172
msgid ""
"On Atlas 300I DUO, keep the value conservative because attention-mask memory"
" grows with the configured maximum length."
msgstr "在Atlas 300I DUO上，请保持该值保守，因为注意力掩码内存会随配置的最大长度增长。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:217
msgid ""
"For general parameter tuning, refer to the [Performance Tuning "
"Guide](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)."
msgstr ""
"关于通用参数调优，请参考[性能调优指南](../../developer_guide/performance_and_debug/optimization_and_tuning.md)。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:219
msgid "10 FAQ"
msgstr "10 常见问题"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:221
msgid ""
"For common environment, installation, and general parameter issues, see the "
"[Public FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html). This"
" section covers model- and hardware-specific guidance."
msgstr ""
"关于常见环境、安装和通用参数问题，请参阅[公共FAQ](https://docs.vllm.ai/projects/ascend/en/latest/faqs.html)。本节涵盖模型和硬件特定的指导。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:223
msgid "Atlas 300I DUO runs out of memory during startup"
msgstr "Atlas 300I DUO在启动过程中内存不足"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:225
msgid ""
"**Symptom:** The server fails with an out-of-memory error while initializing"
" attention."
msgstr "**症状：** 服务器在初始化注意力机制时因内存不足错误而失败。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:227
msgid ""
"**Cause:** On Atlas 300I DUO, an automatically detected large context length"
" can create a full causal attention mask whose memory consumption grows "
"quadratically with `max_model_len`."
msgstr ""
"**原因：**在Atlas 300I "
"DUO上，自动检测到的大上下文长度可能会生成完整的因果注意力掩码，其内存消耗随`max_model_len`呈二次方增长。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/models/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md:229
msgid ""
"**Solution:** Always set `--max-model-len` explicitly to a conservative "
"value, such as `4096`, and increase it only after verifying available NPU "
"memory."
msgstr "**解决方案：** 始终将`--max-model-len`显式设置为保守值（例如`4096`），并在验证可用NPU内存后才增加该值。"

